    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "28560a4d943d0216",
      "translationZh": "我正在协助组织 All Day AI，这是一场将于22日星期四举行的免费线上会议。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18ef4c08655a49c1",
      "translationZh": "我想介绍几位自愿在当天演讲的嘉宾：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d93b243ba1e571f2",
      "translationZh": "Vivienne Hnin（Utilyst）：“小模型，大利润率：SLMs 的经济学与工程权衡。”这正是这个子版块每天都在讨论的问题：什么时候小模型真的已经足够好用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2c64ac81cfd0204f",
      "translationZh": "Hossein Kazemi（Astorna）：“使用面向特定任务的小语言模型处理敏感数据”。将敏感数据保留在本地，是人们自行运行模型的一大原因。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "04e992f7faadb7ca",
      "translationZh": "Hitesh Jain（Coral Bricks AI）：“以250 tokens 编码。”推理速度正是这里的用户热衷于反复进行基准测试的指标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bdd4987e37fd3694",
      "translationZh": "其余日程将很快公布，涵盖四个分会场：Build、Lead、Secure 和 Ship。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38ef12e9662b013f",
      "translationZh": "这些演讲均由社区投稿。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3f3515f7e712e0a",
      "translationZh": "免费报名：https://www.alldayai.com/?utm_source=localllama&utm_medium=reddit",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "912162e3cad47226",
      "translationZh": "我希望这场演讲以及这一领域的其他演讲能帮助你有所发现 我们有一个你可以加入的 discord 频道：https://discord.gg/xUyS3Zu68",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
